{"id":"vod_sn_37294","vodId":"37294","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"野良与皇女与流浪猫之心","name_cn":"野良与皇女与流浪猫之心","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ff8b2dcceac4e225648d7d1d46d3f88f.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在位于湾岸城镇的樱渊市，反田野良（朝井彩加 配音）是一名在那里生活的平凡少年。一天，在上学的途中，野良邂逅了一个名为帕特里西娅（高森奈津美 配音）的奇怪少女，她自称是来自冥界的女皇，而她降临人间的目的，竟然是消灭所有的地上生物，成为地上世界的主宰。　　在误打误撞之中，野良竟然和帕特里西娅接吻了，让野良没有想到的是，自己竟然因此变成了一只猫。就这样，野良和帕特里西娅之间缔结下了契约，不久之后，帕特里西娅的妹妹尤菈夏（大桥步夕 配音）也追随着姐姐的步伐来到了人间。和两个想要毁灭世界的女孩生活在一起，野良的每一天都充满了惊险。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BLxtiQXy3v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wFThKg4Uji1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3MtKAZSASW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R4UDh5AZEe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zx7UYDi3D11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WjPVTx2MD61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mx4Q3LCsSK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kEbEedRT8g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0EETYQAQAs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wDiMEE9xra1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aSVxEV38Qb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZjkXez7rgU1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:12.628Z"}